{
  "about": "GRS-73: the runbook MCP tools every Gears MCP exposes with the same names, required args and args. Checked into gears-api (testdata/runbook-tools.json) and gears-cli (internal/mcpserver/testdata/runbook-tools.json); keep the two files identical. args leaves out the identity arguments workspace and agent. gears-api's test asserts its remote tools equal this list; gears-cli's asserts its local tools carry every one of them, plus localOnly, and none of retired.",
